  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm của cạnh <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông cân tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và \n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tTa có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⊂</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> trong </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình chiếu của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></semantics></math> trên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra góc giữa đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và mặt phẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Xét <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math>, ta có\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⇒</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tVì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>S</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⊂</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> nên ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mn>90</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cot</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>cot</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/eb53e9fdd0d62d0c96d23fb5c1d55bf8cff6568415a5e74b4bb6cf2eed2bbc49.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
